---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/content";
---

<BaseLayout title="Custom Orders" description="Learn how to request a custom dessert order from Rare Treats 518.">
  <section class="page-hero order-hero">
    <div class="site-shell hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Custom orders</p>
        <h1>Start with the occasion. Build the treats from there.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Misty handles custom requests through conversation so the menu, quantity, date, payment, and handoff can be confirmed before anything is promised.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="message-card">
        <span>Include these five things</span>
        <ol>
          <li>The occasion</li>
          <li>Your preferred date</li>
          <li>Estimated quantity or guest count</li>
          <li>The treats or flavors you are considering</li>
          <li>Any dietary or ingredient questions</li>
        </ol>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="site-shell request-flow">
      <article><span>01</span><h2>Send the idea</h2><p>Use Instagram to introduce yourself and share the basic order details.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h2>Review the options</h2><p>Misty confirms availability and discusses the exact products, quantity, final price, and timing.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h2>Confirm the order</h2><p>Payment, pickup or delivery, and any change or cancellation terms are confirmed before the order is accepted.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section message-section">
    <div class="site-shell message-grid soft-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Ready to ask?</p>
        <h2>Message @raretreats518.</h2>
        <p class="lede">A direct message is currently the official inquiry path. A website form should not collect orders until the public email, privacy language, and final workflow are approved.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="button-stack">
        <a class="button" href={site.social.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Open Instagram</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/treats">Review treat categories</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight note-section">
    <div class="site-shell note-grid">
      <h2>What the website does not promise yet</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fixed pricing based on an old event menu</li>
        <li>Guaranteed availability for a specific product or date</li>
        <li>Shipping, delivery coverage, or allergy-safe preparation</li>
        <li>A deposit, refund, or cancellation rule that Misty has not approved</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(20rem, 0.65fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .message-card {
    padding: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(117,213,208,.2), rgba(246,154,190,.16), white);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .message-card > span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--blush-deep);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .message-card ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--blueberry-soft);
  }

  .message-card li {
    padding-block: 0.55rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(39,27,69,.1);
  }

  .message-card li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .request-flow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .request-flow article {
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .request-flow article:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }

  .request-flow span {
    color: var(--aqua-deep);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 850;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  }

  .request-flow h2 {
    margin: 2rem 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.7rem);
  }

  .message-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .message-grid h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .button-stack {
    display: grid;
    min-width: 13rem;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .note-section {
    background: rgba(246,154,190,.09);
  }

  .note-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }

  .note-grid h2 {
    max-width: 11ch;
  }

  .note-grid ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--blueberry-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .hero-grid,
    .message-grid,
    .note-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .request-flow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .request-flow article {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .request-flow article:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
